-- AND THE 86 OVERLAYS, which the postcondition caught during the rehearsal. The invariant says
-- "every role has a necessity status and explicit reason" — every role, not every accountable
-- role. The package carries necessity_status on the canonical role registry and not on the
-- overlay registry, so the obvious move was to narrow the check to the 90. That would have been
-- weakening a check to fit the data. An overlay's necessity is decidable without the package
-- inventing a column: it exists on demand, for exactly one category, and the registry says which.
